{"author":{"uri":{"label":"https://itunes.apple.com/vn/reviews/id268472045"}, "name":{"label":"anhtran9211"}, "label":""}, "updated":{"label":"2026-10-04T08:10:47-07:00"}, "im:rating":{"label":"1"}, "im:version":{"label":"26.40"}, "id":{"label":"14627098627"}, "title":{"label":"Terrible experience"}, "content":{"label":"Terrible experience! My check-in was delayed by 3 hours, and the room was not as expected. Airbnb Support failed to help me find alternative accommodation, leaving me to book a new place at my own expense. Extremely disappointing customer service. I would not recommend Airbnb!", "attributes":{"type":"text"}}, "link":{"attributes":{"rel":"related", "href":"https://itunes.apple.com/vn/review?id=401626263&type=Purple%20Software"}}, "im:voteSum":{"label":"0"}, "im:contentType":{"attributes":{"term":"Application", "label":"Application"}}, "im:voteCount":{"label":"0"}}, 
{"author":{"uri":{"label":"https://itunes.apple.com/vn/reviews/id1971947092"}, "name":{"label":"ngtqg"}, "label":""}, "updated":{"label":"2026-09-23T10:16:09-07:00"}, "im:rating":{"label":"1"}, "im:version":{"label":"26.38.1"}, "id":{"label":"14584751569"}, "title":{"label":"LOOK DOWN ON CUSTOMER!"}, "content":{"label":"The first time in early June or July, when I was making a payment, Airbnb asked me to verify my information, after scanning my face, my account was locked, after the complaint, that account was reopened, I booked a room and paid. \n\nSuddenly 3 months later, they emailed back that my booking had been canceled and my account was deleted again with the reason that this account was same as an account that had been removed. After I complained, they (the guy named Harvey) put me on the blacklist for NO REASON.\n\nThis app is terrible 👎🏻", "attributes":{"type":"text"}}, "link":{"attributes":{"rel":"related", "href":"https://itunes.apple.com/vn/review?id=401626263&type=Purple%20Software"}}, "im:voteSum":{"label":"0"}, "im:contentType":{"attributes":{"term":"Application", "label":"Application"}}, "im:voteCount":{"label":"0"}}, 
