{"author":{"uri":{"label":"https://itunes.apple.com/vn/reviews/id1419565626"}, "name":{"label":"Eward_Huynh"}, "label":""}, "updated":{"label":"2026-09-16T08:22:08-07:00"}, "im:rating":{"label":"1"}, "im:version":{"label":"26.37"}, "id":{"label":"14556932402"}, "title":{"label":"Disappointing Airbnb Support – 1 Star"}, "content":{"label":"Reservation HM4TXHJR8B, which was scheduled for check-in on September 11.\nI try to escalate to the issue to further assistance from airbnb but there is no hope from who is entitled as Senior Case Manager.\n\nAirbnb admitted making an administrative error that negatively affected my hosting account. Although my account was eventually restored, they refused to provide any compensation for the financial losses caused by their mistake.\n\nThe escalation process was frustrating, and no further review was available. As a host, I expected greater accountability and fair treatment from Airbnb.", "attributes":{"type":"text"}}, "link":{"attributes":{"rel":"related", "href":"https://itunes.apple.com/vn/review?id=401626263&type=Purple%20Software"}}, "im:voteSum":{"label":"0"}, "im:contentType":{"attributes":{"term":"Application", "label":"Application"}}, "im:voteCount":{"label":"0"}}, 
