{"author":{"uri":{"label":"https://itunes.apple.com/vn/reviews/id1001405138"}, "name":{"label":"Maycaous"}, "label":""}, "updated":{"label":"2026-08-18T22:26:30-07:00"}, "im:rating":{"label":"1"}, "im:version":{"label":"26.33"}, "id":{"label":"14445540618"}, "title":{"label":"Airbnb’s inconsistent Review Policy for Host"}, "content":{"label":"Airbnb’s policy extremely inconsistent and unfair for hosts. Previously, Airbnb told me that if the guests did not check in, did not stay overnight and cancelled reservation themselves, they would not be eligible to leave a review. Yet in this exact situation, Airbnb allowed to guest leave the review and ask the host to leave a review. This directly contradicts Airbnb’s own policy and is frustrating, unfair for the host, also creating a chance for dishonest guests or competitors to take advantage  of the system and unfairly harm hosts. Be careful when you want to download this app.", "attributes":{"type":"text"}}, "link":{"attributes":{"rel":"related", "href":"https://itunes.apple.com/vn/review?id=401626263&type=Purple%20Software"}}, "im:voteSum":{"label":"0"}, "im:contentType":{"attributes":{"term":"Application", "label":"Application"}}, "im:voteCount":{"label":"0"}}, 
