{"author":{"uri":{"label":"https://itunes.apple.com/vn/reviews/id489200390"}, "name":{"label":"Lamkanho"}, "label":""}, "updated":{"label":"2026-06-05T07:59:02-07:00"}, "im:rating":{"label":"1"}, "im:version":{"label":"26.23.1"}, "id":{"label":"14147081387"}, "title":{"label":"Terrible booking experience with Airbnb, I lost my money in void"}, "content":{"label":"I booking my hotel to the Netherlands for a business trip from 16th to 19th of June at The Alfred hotel Amsterdam since week 3 of May.\nHowever something comes up and have news from the Embassy that my visa application will not be approved on time.\nFrom 20th of May, I have been chatting nonstop with the host, in hope that they can help me reschedule the days, I am willing to pay more for service fee, plus want to stay more day than my previous plan there, but they keep ghosting me.\n\nWhen the time is getting closer, I contact with Airbnb support team, and their is basically nothing they can do to help me, all their saying is if the host don't want to support me to change the date, there is nothing I can do.\n\nHonestly, you are in the service business, is this really the way to treat the client? I speechless with their hotel suppliers, and speechless with the way Airbnb support their customers. \nI have been using Airbnb for many years, and this is my last!", "attributes":{"type":"text"}}, "link":{"attributes":{"rel":"related", "href":"https://itunes.apple.com/vn/review?id=401626263&type=Purple%20Software"}}, "im:voteSum":{"label":"0"}, "im:contentType":{"attributes":{"term":"Application", "label":"Application"}}, "im:voteCount":{"label":"0"}}, 
